<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular" style="">Thank you for your hard work and participation in the Leaders Save Lives program.&nbsp; You did a great job and we appreciate the time and energy you spent recruiting donors for your blood drive.&nbsp; Your work as a Blood Program Leader helped to provide blood products, making a lasting impact for hospital patients and their loved ones.&nbsp; We can't thank you enough!</font><div style=""><font face="Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular">We need your support again by hosting another Leaders Save Lives blood drive to ensure blood products are available for patients in need.&nbsp; Can we count on you again to help patients who rely on lifesaving blood donations?</font></div><div style=""><font face="Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular">Your next Leaders Save Lives blood drive could make a difference for hospital patients and we hope we can count on your again.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;">Please contact me with any questions or to schedule your next Leaders Save Lives blood drive!<br><br></span></div><div style="">P.S. No longer a student or unable to host another drive?&nbsp; You can make a difference by identifying a high school or college student to carry on the blood drive program.&nbsp; Please forward this message and encourage them to host a leaders save lives blood drive.<div style=""><br></div><div style="">Kind regards,</div><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102); font-size: 12pt;">[Insert Name]</span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
